  <Analysis>
    <Title>Pagefile - Win\Mac</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>Information about Pagefile across Mac and Windows </P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>NOT in proxy agent context</Relevance>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system or mac of operating system</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="1" Name="Pagefile - Current Size - Win\Mac" EvaluationPeriod="P1D">sum of sizes of (if (Windows of Operating System) then (files &quot;pagefile.sys&quot; of folders ((name of it &amp; &quot;\&quot;) of drives)) else (if (Mac of Operating System) then (files whose (name of it starts with &quot;swapfile&quot;) of folder &quot;/private/var/vm&quot;) else (ERROR &quot;Unknown&quot;)))</Property>
  </Analysis>
